rder-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let point: [number, number] = [10, 20];\r\nlet entry: [string, number] = [&quot;age&quot;, 30];\r\n// entry = [30, &quot;age&quot;];   // 오류: 순서와 타입이 고정\r\n\r\nconst [key, value] = entry;   // 구조 분해</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong>길이와 각 위치의 타입이 고정</strong>된 배열</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">선택 요소 · 이름 · 나머지</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">type Range = [start: number, end?: number];        // 이름 + 선택 요소\r\ntype Log = [level: string, ...messages: string[]]; // 나머지 요소\r\n\r\nconst r: Range = [1];\r\nconst l: Log = [&quot;info&quot;, &quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;];</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">자주 쓰는 곳 — 여러 값 반환</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function useCounter(): [number, () =&gt; void] {\r\n  let n = 0;\r\n  return [n, () =&gt; { n++; }];\r\n}\r\nconst [count, inc] = useCounter();   // React useState 와 같은 형태</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/object/tuple","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"object","title":"객체 · 컬렉션","path":"it/syntax/typescript/object"}],"hasImage":false}